Malaga Event Gear delivers, installs and tests a projection screen, a projector and PA sound for outdoor venues across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. We supply the equipment and the crew. The film, and the right to show it, are yours.

Contact us today to explore our [range of equipment and packages](/packages/).

